_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 162, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 163", "text": "입찰참가서류제출"}, {"block_index": 155, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 163, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 164", "text": "입 찰 건 명"}, {"block_index": 156, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 164, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 165", "text": "입"}, {"block_index": 157, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 165, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 166", "text": "찰"}, {"block_index": 158, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 166, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 167", "text": "보"}, {"block_index": 159, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 167, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 168", "text": "증"}, {"block_index": 160, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 168, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 169", "text": "금"}, {"block_index": 161, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 169, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 170", "text": "납 부"}, {"block_index": 162, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 170, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 171", "text": "ㅇ보증금율 : 이상 ㅇ보증금납부방법 :"}, {"block_index": 163, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 171, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 172", "text": "ㅇ보증액 : 금 원정(￦ )"}, {"block_index": 164, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 172, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 173", "text": "대사"}, {"block_index": 165, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 173, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 174", "text": "리용"}, {"block_index": 166, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 174, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 175", "text": "인인"}, {"block_index": 167, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 175, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 176", "text": "․ 감"}, {"block_index": 168, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 176, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 177", "text": "본 입찰에 관한 일체의 권한을 다음의 자에게"}, {"block_index": 169, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 177, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 178", "text": "위임합니다."}, {"block_index": 170, "secti